1
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:04,600
我爸寄来了个包裹
We got a package from my dad.

2
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:05,680
盒子上没有气孔
No air holes in the box.

3
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:06,360
这是个好兆头
That's a good sign.

4
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:07,880
莉莉很喜欢那只小鸡
Lily loved having that chicken.

5
00:00:07,980 --> 00:00:09,520
后来吃得也很开心 尽管她不知情
One more time than she realized.

6
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:11,260
我刚收到婚礼歌手的电邮
Listen, I just got an e-mail from our wedding singer.

7
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:12,760
-他有个小要求 -又来吗
- He has a small request. - Another one?

8
00:00:12,820 --> 00:00:14,840
婚礼歌手何时开始向我们提要求了
Since when does the wedding singer send us requests?

9
00:00:15,160 --> 00:00:17,260
不 他只是想把你的几首歌换掉
Well, no, he just wants to change a few songs in your medley

10
00:00:17,260 --> 00:00:19,040
以免跟他要表演的部分重复
to avoid overlap with the stuff that he's performing.

11
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:20,720
可别换了我的重头戏
Well, I hope it's none of my showstoppers.

12
00:00:20,900 --> 00:00:22,340
你的歌都是重头戏啦
Oh, they're all showstoppers.

13
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:23,380
你太好了
Oh, you're too kind.

14
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:27,460
天啊 是我们
Oh, my gosh, it's us.

15
00:00:27,960 --> 00:00:29,400
放在我们的婚礼蛋糕上
For our wedding cake.

16
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:30,640
是不是激动得要死了
Couldn't you just die?

17
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:31,960
我真觉得我要死了
I really think I could.

18
00:00:32,200 --> 00:00:33,460
我爸爸做的
My dad made this.

19
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:35,520
他可是世界级的肥皂雕刻师
He's a world-class soap carver.

20
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:36,520
我小时候有一次说脏话
You know, once, when I was a kid, I cussed,

21
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:38,100
我妈妈用他雕的比萨斜塔
and my mom washed my mouth out

22
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:39,280
洗我的嘴
with the leaning tower of Pisa.

23
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:42,360
她到现在还在自责
She still blames herself to this day.

24
00:00:42,547 --> 00:00:45,400
本来我是会马上反对那个婚礼蛋糕人偶的
Oh, I would have nixed that wedding topper immediately,

25
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:47,040
但小卡跟我有项协议
but Cam and I have an agreement.

26
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:49,840
我们每人有三次否决对方婚礼创意的机会
We -- we each got three vetoes of each other's wedding ideas --

27
00:00:49,960 --> 00:00:51,000
无需任何理由
No questions asked.

28
00:00:51,010 --> 00:00:53,983
倒是 实施了那么一小会儿
And it -- it worked for...a while

29
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:56,340
你会爱上我的婚礼公告牌的
I think you're gonna love my wedding board.

30
00:00:56,440 --> 00:00:57,780
我也非常激动
I'm pretty excited, too.

31
00:00:59,480 --> 00:00:59,740
-反对 -反对
- Veto. - Veto.

32
00:01:00,080 --> 00:01:01,180
-反对 -反对
- Veto. - Veto.

33
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:03,440
很抱歉我太激动了
I'm sorry I'm so emotional.

34
00:01:04,020 --> 00:01:06,380
真的是最棒的礼物了
It's just the nicest thing ever.

35
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:08,240
你不觉得我看起来有点
You don't think that I look just a little bit --

36
00:01:08,240 --> 00:01:10,380
我爸爸忍着关节炎刻出来的
I mean, my dad carved through his arthritis!

37
00:01:10,380 --> 00:01:11,360
可能是因为那只翘起来的腿
Maybe it's the kicky leg.

38
00:01:11,440 --> 00:01:14,380
想想他用一双残手雕刻所投入的时间
I mean, the hours his ruined hands put into this.

39
00:01:14,780 --> 00:01:16,580
他在肥皂中挖掘到了我们
He found us in soap.

40
00:01:17,480 --> 00:01:18,940
今天 米奇尔 我懂得了爱
Today, mitchell, I know love.

41
00:01:20,238 --> 00:01:21,768
我也懂得了"唉"
I no love, either.

42
00:01:33,080 --> 00:01:37,780
你四处看看吧
So, take your time looking around.

43
00:01:37,980 --> 00:01:38,300
谢谢
Thanks.

44
00:01:39,580 --> 00:01:41,020
我在帮歌洛莉亚卖掉她在认识杰之前
I'm helping Gloria sell the old apartment

45
00:01:41,020 --> 00:01:42,720
和曼尼住的旧公寓
that she and Manny lived in before she met Jay.

46
00:01:42,720 --> 00:01:44,400
这里的邻居前卫大胆
It's in an up-and-coming neighborhood

47
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:46,140
拥有鲜明独特的多元文化趋向
with a distinct multicultural bent

48
00:01:46,140 --> 00:01:47,920
正在经历着令人欣喜的城市复兴
that's undergoing an exciting urban renewal.

49
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:51,980
换个说法就是"基佬们发现了这块宝地"
That's a fancy way of saying "The gays found it."

50
00:01:51,980 --> 00:01:54,060
难以置信我在这里住了五年
I can't believe that I lived here for five years.

51
00:01:54,620 --> 00:01:56,340
连开灯都很痛苦
Even turning the lights on was a pain.

52
00:01:56,380 --> 00:01:57,600
你看
Look at this.

53
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:01,080
小点声 你个婊子
Keep it down, you bitch!

54
00:02:01,090 --> 00:02:03,960
里维拉太太还活着
Ay. Mrs. Rivera's still alive.

55
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:06,080
我还真中意这地方
I am really digging this place.

56
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:06,760
是吧
Right?

57
00:02:06,940 --> 00:02:08,500
瞧瞧这燃气灶 线脚
The gas stove, the moldings --

58
00:02:08,500 --> 00:02:09,980
如今很难找到这样的房子了
they don't make 'em like this anymore.

59
00:02:09,980 --> 00:02:10,940
我可能会全拆掉
I'll probably gut it.

60
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:11,480
全拆掉
Rip it out.

61
00:02:11,500 --> 00:02:12,300
我也会这么做
That's what I'd do.

62
00:02:13,498 --> 00:02:15,289
我会让我的承包人来看看
I want my contractor to swing by,

63
00:02:15,300 --> 00:02:16,540
但我真的很喜欢这里
but I really like it.

64
00:02:16,580 --> 00:02:18,100
太好了 好极了 谢谢
Great. All right. Thanks.

65
00:02:18,100 --> 00:02:19,530
-拜拜 -再联系
- Bye-bye. - Talk to you soon.

66
00:02:19,540 --> 00:02:21,500
真高兴认识你
So nice to meet you.

67
00:02:22,720 --> 00:02:23,640
我才不卖给他
I'm not selling to him.

68
00:02:23,940 --> 00:02:24,940
什么 真的吗
What? Really?

69
00:02:25,040 --> 00:02:26,180
他是个不错的买家啊
He's a quality buyer.

70
00:02:26,220 --> 00:02:27,700
你也不想再找租客了
You're tired of finding renters.

71
00:02:27,920 --> 00:02:29,680
这房子是给一大家子人住的
This is a family building.

72
00:02:30,260 --> 00:02:31,540
一大家子几代人
Generations have lived there,

73
00:02:31,540 --> 00:02:33,200
往往是数世同堂
and usually at the same time.

74
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:35,415
他不过是想转手赚钱
He just wants to flip it.

75
00:02:35,580 --> 00:02:36,000
好吧
Okay.

76
00:02:36,660 --> 00:02:38,900
还有另一个买家大概一小时后能到
I got a backup I can probably get here in an hour.

77
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:40,580
你想去那里面等吗
You want to wait in there?

78
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:41,700
你走进去
You walk in that door,

79
00:02:41,700 --> 00:02:42,720
就别想出来了
you never come out.

80
00:02:42,720 --> 00:02:44,880
不不 不是那家酒吧 是那家咖啡厅
No, no, not the bar -- the coffee shop.

81
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:46,100
对啊 我说的就是那个
Yeah, that's what I'm talking about.

82
00:02:46,721 --> 00:02:48,700
但我们可以去隔壁等
But we can wait next door.

83
00:02:48,700 --> 00:02:51,400
那是我以前工作过的美发店
That's my old hair salon where I used to work.

84
00:02:51,780 --> 00:02:53,120
去那里也有的喝
You can get drinks there, too.

85
00:02:54,620 --> 00:02:56,002
歌洛莉亚
Gloria!

86
00:03:01,509 --> 00:03:03,344
不不不 这不是杰
No, no, no, it's not Jay.

87
00:03:07,667 --> 00:03:08,930
什么这么好笑
What's so funny?

88
00:03:09,305 --> 00:03:10,371
什么这么好笑
What's so funny?

89
00:03:10,460 --> 00:03:12,280
她以为你是我情人
She thinks you're my lover.

90
00:03:12,740 --> 00:03:13,920
太好笑了
That is funny!

91
00:03:13,920 --> 00:03:16,819
我不确定是不是值得一屋子女人捧腹大笑
I don't know if it's "a room full of women laughing" funny,

92
00:03:17,027 --> 00:03:17,522
但是
but...

93
00:03:17,522 --> 00:03:18,660
丽塔 不是啦
Ay, Rita, no.

94
00:03:18,660 --> 00:03:20,620
菲尔是我的一个朋友
Phil is a friend of mine,

95
00:03:20,620 --> 00:03:22,840
我们在等人 过来消磨点时间
and we're just killing time before an appointment.

96
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,420
我也不想这样 歌洛莉亚
I hate to ask, Gloria,

97
00:03:24,460 --> 00:03:26,200
但我新招的店员还没来
but my new girl hasn't shown up.

98
00:03:27,200 --> 00:03:28,860
你可以帮忙吗
Any chance you could help?

99
00:03:28,860 --> 00:03:30,463
当然可以啦
Ay, of course!

100
00:03:30,463 --> 00:03:32,675
一定会很好玩的
It will be so much fun!

101
00:03:33,540 --> 00:03:35,080
我不想毁了我的指甲
I don't want to ruin my nails.

102
00:03:35,160 --> 00:03:36,780
菲尔 你能帮忙洗头吗
Phil, would you do my shampooing?

103
00:03:36,780 --> 00:03:38,120
应该可以吧
Well, I-I guess so.

104
00:03:38,120 --> 00:03:38,860
我们还有时间
We've got the time.

105
00:03:38,920 --> 00:03:39,560
我得声明一下
Just a warning --

106
00:03:39,580 --> 00:03:41,840
大学后我就没有专业洗过头发了
I haven't shampooed professionally since college,

107
00:03:41,840 --> 00:03:44,400
那只是一份兼职 来付拉拉队服装的钱
and that was only part-time to pay for my cheer gear.

108
00:03:44,423 --> 00:03:47,425
我真是太爱炫了
Wow. That was super-braggy.

109
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:48,728
这里有什么 并排水槽吗
What do we got, double sinks?

110
00:03:48,740 --> 00:03:49,920
花洒还好使吗
What's the nozzle sitch?

111
00:03:50,160 --> 00:03:51,720
我不想太炫耀自己
Not to sound too braggy,

112
00:03:51,720 --> 00:03:52,860
但你妈妈我这周工作
but your mom was kind of

113
00:03:52,860 --> 00:03:54,480
是上天入地无所不能
a badass at work this week.

114
00:03:54,490 --> 00:03:56,520
外公病了 我突然掌管大权
It was hard enough with grandpa being sick

115
00:03:56,520 --> 00:03:57,820
这就已经够艰难了
and me suddenly in charge,

116
00:03:58,100 --> 00:04:01,620
但危机真是一个接一个啊
but it was just one crisis after another.

117
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:03,600
卢克 亲爱的 我们要走了
Luke, honey, we're going!

118
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:05,240
仓库起火
Fire in the warehouse,

119
00:04:05,600 --> 00:04:07,160
职业安全和健康署突击检查
surprise inspection from OSHA,

120
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:09,080
我们最大的顾客企图取消订单
our biggest buyer tried to pull out of a deal,

121
00:04:09,080 --> 00:04:10,960
我得让他打消这个念头
and I have to talk him off a ledge.

122
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:12,440
随便啦 都结束了
Whatever. It's over now.

123
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:14,620
我不想说这些来让你们觉得无聊
I don't want to bore you guys with this stuff.

124
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:16,740
我周三去上班时
So, when I get to work on Wednesday,

125
00:04:16,740 --> 00:04:18,240
玛格利特已经在哭了
Margaret is ready in tears,

126
00:04:18,240 --> 00:04:19,860
接待室里有两名警察
and there are two cops in the waiting room,

127
00:04:19,860 --> 00:04:20,600
我对他们说
and I say to them,

128
00:04:20,960 --> 00:04:22,140
你们最好有人能开18轮巨型货车
"One of you had better be able to drive an 18-wheeler,

129
00:04:22,620 --> 00:04:25,300
因为我要送100块紫檀板去胜利谷
"because I've got 100 rosewood panels to get to Victorville,

130
00:04:25,300 --> 00:04:26,500
不然我就要用薪水补偿了
or it's coming out of my paycheck."

131
00:04:26,511 --> 00:04:28,021
我跟你们说过司机和变质金枪鱼的事了吗
I told you guys about the drivers and the bad tuna?

132
00:04:28,032 --> 00:04:28,992
-变质金枪鱼 -对
- Bad tuna, - Yes.

133
00:04:28,992 --> 00:04:30,287
-说了 -我的确说了
- yeah. - Yes, I did.

134
00:04:31,420 --> 00:04:33,900
妈妈 我都忘记这辆车有多好玩了
Hey, mom, I forgot how fun this car was.

135
00:04:33,900 --> 00:04:36,029
自动门 还有后排的电视
And these automatic doors and that TV in the back.

136
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,020
你知道还有什么很好玩吗
You know what else was fun?

137
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:39,520
他们周五为我办的派对
The party they threw for me at work on Friday.

138
00:04:39,520 --> 00:04:40,900
那的确有点尴尬啦
I mean, it was a little bit embarrassing.

139
00:04:40,900 --> 00:04:43,050
我都不知道还有"英雌"这个词儿
I didn't even know "She-ro" was a word,

140
00:04:43,060 --> 00:04:45,380
结果他们用糖霜写了这个词
and there it was, in icing.

141
00:04:46,860 --> 00:04:47,740
好啊好啊
Hello, hello!

142
00:04:48,620 --> 00:04:50,060
欢迎来到杰之夜
Welcome to Jay's night.

143
00:04:50,280 --> 00:04:50,800
请报上尊姓大名
Names, please.

144
00:04:50,900 --> 00:04:51,700
确保你在邀请名单内
Want to make sure you're on the list.

145
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:53,240
开玩笑啦 我很激动
Kidding! Just excited.

146
00:04:53,420 --> 00:04:54,440
吧台上有开胃菜
Appetizers on the bar,

147
00:04:54,840 --> 00:04:56,060
咖啡桌上有拼词游戏
scrabble on the coffee table,

148
00:04:56,060 --> 00:04:57,760
还有我们的特色演讲
and our feature presentation,

149
00:04:58,160 --> 00:04:58,740
"超级大逃亡"
"The Great Escape."

150
00:04:58,960 --> 00:04:59,880
说到这个 海莉
Speaking of which, Haley...

151
00:04:59,880 --> 00:05:00,840
别担心 外公
Don't worry, grandpa.

152
00:05:00,860 --> 00:05:01,780
我不会走的
I'm not leaving.

153
00:05:02,260 --> 00:05:03,680
我今晚没安排
I have no plans for the night.

154
00:05:03,780 --> 00:05:04,200
我也没有
Me, either.

155
00:05:04,460 --> 00:05:05,740
但我没安排是了不得的新闻
But when I say it, it's news.

156
00:05:05,820 --> 00:05:07,100
你说了任何一句完整的话
When you say any complete sentence,

157
00:05:07,100 --> 00:05:07,540
都是了不得的新闻
it's news.

158
00:05:07,540 --> 00:05:09,280
别吵了 姑娘们 爸 你好些了吗
Okay, girls. Dad, you feeling better?

159
00:05:09,400 --> 00:05:10,140
你这周很难受 对吧
You had a rough week, huh?

160
00:05:10,140 --> 00:05:11,480
我没事
Nah. I'm fine.

161
00:05:11,480 --> 00:05:12,580
看来你这周很忙啊
Looks like you had a big week.

162
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:13,760
你听说了吗
You heard about that?

163
00:05:14,040 --> 00:05:16,560
办公室八卦的所有细节都尽在我掌握
Yeah, I got the blow-by-blow on all the office drama.

164
00:05:16,700 --> 00:05:18,260
顺便说一句 真的...
By the way, sincerely...

165
00:05:18,260 --> 00:05:19,120
什么
Yeah?

166
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:19,540
超棒...
...great...

167
00:05:20,980 --> 00:05:22,260
吧台那边的鳄梨色拉酱超棒
great guacamole on the bar, there.

168
00:05:25,280 --> 00:05:26,480
就这样吗
Wow. That's it?

169
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:27,940
你为他做了那么多事
Everything you did for him,

170
00:05:27,940 --> 00:05:29,140
他都不说一句谢谢吗
and he doesn't even say "Thank you"?

171
00:05:29,860 --> 00:05:31,180
我明白了
I get it.

172
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:33,080
是"英雄"中的"雄"换成了"雌"
It's "Hero" with a "She."

173
00:05:33,980 --> 00:05:35,200
好 我跟上了
Okay, I'm up to speed.

174
00:05:35,700 --> 00:05:36,940
是啊 太冷漠了
Yeah, that was cold.

175
00:05:37,120 --> 00:05:38,160
他就是这样
It's just his way.

176
00:05:38,500 --> 00:05:39,580
多年的失望过后
After years of disappointment,

177
00:05:39,700 --> 00:05:42,400
我学会了不指望我爸给我肯定
I have learned not to expect a pat on the head from my dad.

178
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:44,160
他做不到
He's not capable of it.

179
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:46,620
但这教会了我一个很重要的教训
But it has taught me a very important lesson

180
00:05:46,620 --> 00:05:48,440
你们也该学学
that you girls should learn, too --

181
00:05:48,700 --> 00:05:50,480
自我肯定首先要来源于自身
approval comes from within.

182
00:05:50,760 --> 00:05:51,580
我知道 妈妈
I knew that, mom.

183
00:05:51,580 --> 00:05:53,075
你当然知道啦 因为你聪明
'Course you did, 'cause you're smart.

184
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:58,340
莉莉从浴缸里出来了吗
Hey, is Lily out of the tub?

185
00:05:58,340 --> 00:05:59,680
我们得赶去我爸家了
We got to be at my dad's soon.

186
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:00,460
不
Oh, no!

187
00:06:00,620 --> 00:06:01,520
没什么大不了的
It's not that big of a deal.

188
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:02,455
我们可以稍微迟到一会儿
We can be a little late.

189
00:06:02,455 --> 00:06:04,100
不 莉莉把我们的蛋糕人偶
No! Lily had the cake topper

190
00:06:04,100 --> 00:06:05,520
带进浴缸了
in the tub with her!

191
00:06:06,140 --> 00:06:08,500
不 怎么会犯这么严重的错误呢
Oh, no. How could such a terrible mistake have occurred?

192
00:06:08,580 --> 00:06:10,920
我想她一定以为那是个玩具之类的
I think she must have just thought it was a toy or something.

193
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,860
希望人偶没有被玩坏
Well, I hope it's not completely ruined forever.

194
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:14,240
没有 你开玩笑吧
Oh, no. Are you kidding me?

195
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:16,400
我爸爸用了特殊的虫胶清漆
My daddy uses a special shellac on this thing.

196
00:06:16,400 --> 00:06:17,896
这玩意儿能防水
This is water-resistant,

197
00:06:17,896 --> 00:06:19,860
隔热 百毒不侵
heat-resistant -- you name it.

198
00:06:19,860 --> 00:06:20,320
真好
Good to know.

199
00:06:20,420 --> 00:06:21,520
是啊 放在安全的地方
Yeah, but put it someplace safe.

200
00:06:21,520 --> 00:06:22,360
可能还有点滑
It could still be slippery,

201
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:22,940
小心点
so be careful.

202
00:06:23,060 --> 00:06:23,560
是吗
Is it?

203
00:06:23,620 --> 00:06:24,280
是啊 的确是
Oh, yeah, it is!

204
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:24,880
好滑
It's slippery!

205
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:25,700
没坏吧
Is it okay?

206
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:27,820
安然无恙
Not a scratch.

207
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:30,480
显然我比看上去要强壮
Apparently, I'm tougher than I look.

208
00:06:32,900 --> 00:06:34,180
孩子们 玩得开心吗
Hey, boys. Having fun?

209
00:06:34,300 --> 00:06:34,920
你知道的
You know it.

210
00:06:34,980 --> 00:06:36,060
我们喜欢杰之夜
Love us some Jay's night.

211
00:06:37,400 --> 00:06:38,800
好了 我们走吧
Okay, we're out of here.

212
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:39,908
克里斯蒂·休斯
Kristy Hughes,

213
00:06:39,908 --> 00:06:41,560
外号"克里斯蒂·胸器"
A.K.A. "Kristy huge ones,"

214
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:43,620
在两个街区外开泳池派对
is having a pool party two blocks away.

215
00:06:43,880 --> 00:06:44,700
那杰怎么办
What about Jay?

216
00:06:44,700 --> 00:06:45,780
他认为我们就是在开派对
He thinks we're at a party.

217
00:06:45,900 --> 00:06:46,660
他不会知道的
He'll never know.

218
00:06:46,820 --> 00:06:48,340
我们偷偷溜出去 溜进屋里
We sneak out, work the room,

219
00:06:48,580 --> 00:06:49,360
欣赏大胸
cannonball, cannonball,

220
00:06:49,360 --> 00:06:50,640
然后我们赶回来吃晚餐
and we're back in time for dinner.

221
00:06:50,740 --> 00:06:51,600
你被邀请了吗
Were you even invited?

222
00:06:51,980 --> 00:06:52,420
没有
No.

223
00:06:52,920 --> 00:06:55,240
但那只是因为我不认识她或她的朋友
But that's only because I don't know her or any of her friends.

224
00:06:55,540 --> 00:06:56,900
非法入侵的事咱们不能干
We're not invading her house.

225
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:58,880
再说 我这头发在泳池派对上
Besides, this hair at a pool party --

226
00:06:59,100 --> 00:07:00,620
一碰水就跟安全气囊似的爆开了
One dunk, and it goes off like an airbag.

227
00:07:05,860 --> 00:07:07,120
这是什么 你做了酱汁吗
What's this? You made sauce?

228
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,000
你生病了
Well, you were sick.

229
00:07:08,000 --> 00:07:09,180
我不知道你能不能坚持做饭
I didn't know if you could handle it.

230
00:07:09,480 --> 00:07:11,620
越战的时候我得了肝炎
Back in Vietnam, I had hepatitis.

231
00:07:12,020 --> 00:07:13,880
照样给三百个士兵准备了
Still managed to cook Thanksgiving dinner

232
00:07:13,880 --> 00:07:14,880
感恩节晚餐
for 300 soldiers.

233
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,480
我觉得我能搞得定酱汁
I think I can handle sauce.

234
00:07:16,760 --> 00:07:18,000
我这不是帮你省了麻烦嘛
Well, I saved you the trouble.

235
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:21,580
玛格利特告诉我公司在用新的运货卡车
So, Margaret tells me I'm using some new delivery trucks now.

236
00:07:21,740 --> 00:07:23,360
是的 它们都是混合动力的
Yeah. They're hybrid.

237
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:24,980
确实贵一些
Now, they cost a little more,

238
00:07:24,980 --> 00:07:26,940
但是我把使用绿色产品的
but when I factored in the tax rebates

239
00:07:26,940 --> 00:07:28,160
退税算上
you get for going green,

240
00:07:28,220 --> 00:07:29,260
我们就把钱赚回来了
we come out ahead.

241
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:29,940
提到绿色
Speaking of "Green,"

242
00:07:29,960 --> 00:07:31,560
你蔬菜放得太多了吧
you went a little heavy on the vegetables, huh?

243
00:07:31,560 --> 00:07:33,840
我不确定我能吃下任何健康食物
I'm not sure I can stomach anything that's healthy.

244
00:07:33,840 --> 00:07:36,211
天啊 妈妈 那些卡车听起来真不错
Gosh, mom, that truck thing sounds so amazing.

245
00:07:36,211 --> 00:07:37,456
是啊
Yeah!

246
00:07:37,740 --> 00:07:38,860
没关系 爸
It's fine, dad.

247
00:07:39,420 --> 00:07:41,420
只做力所能及的 对吧
Only do what we're capable of, right?

248
00:07:41,420 --> 00:07:41,700
该死
Oh, damn.

249
00:07:41,700 --> 00:07:43,340
不 斯黛拉 站住 不行
No, Stella, stay. No.

250
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:44,800
乖狗狗
Good girl.

251
00:07:45,200 --> 00:07:46,120
谢谢 斯黛拉
Thank you, Stella.

252
00:07:46,780 --> 00:07:48,180
谢谢你听我的话
Thank you for listening.

253
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:51,200
我太为你骄傲了
Oh, I'm so proud of you.

254
00:07:51,540 --> 00:07:52,920
谁是我的好闺女
Who's my best girl?

255
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:56,280
不用了
Don't.

256
00:07:57,240 --> 00:07:59,180
好了姑娘们 我们准备好拼字游戏了
Okay, girls, we are ready for scrabble.

257
00:07:59,180 --> 00:08:00,400
我去拿些零食
I'll grab some snacks.

258
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:01,670
我要薯片 拜托了
Uh, potato chips, please.

259
00:08:01,680 --> 00:08:02,840
然后我就能整晚听你抱怨
Oh, so I can hear about how much

260
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:04,120
你有多讨厌自己了
you hate yourself all night?

261
00:08:10,900 --> 00:08:11,820
你好 卢克
Hello, Luke.

262
00:08:12,300 --> 00:08:13,920
拜托 我们去吧
Come on! We've got to go!

263
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,560
那个派对上都是高二的学生
That party's full of sophomores.

264
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:16,840
那些学姐们可都是过来人
Those women have lived.

265
00:08:16,980 --> 00:08:18,320
不 我们现在回屋去
No, we're going back inside,

266
00:08:18,460 --> 00:08:19,260
吃杰准备的食物
we're eating Jay's food,

267
00:08:19,260 --> 00:08:20,420
然后玩他的桌游
and we're playing his board games.

268
00:08:20,540 --> 00:08:21,800
应该叫"无聊"游戏吧
More like boring games.

269
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:22,837
那名字本身就和"无聊"读音相同
They're already called "Board."

270
00:08:22,837 --> 00:08:24,540
你没必要再做多余演绎了
You don't make it more clever by --

271
00:08:24,580 --> 00:08:25,360
算了
Never mind.

272
00:08:29,780 --> 00:08:30,660
好的 谢谢
Okay. Thanks.

273
00:08:31,223 --> 00:08:32,600
你和婚礼主唱把问题都解决了吗
Did you work everything out with the wedding singer?

274
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:34,180
是的 我刚放弃了我的压轴表演
Oh, yeah -- I'm just dropping my big finale

275
00:08:34,180 --> 00:08:35,460
因为他要唱同一首歌
because he's doing the same song.

276
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:35,960
《我的路》吗
"My Way"?

277
00:08:36,360 --> 00:08:36,880
已经是他的路了
His way.

278
00:08:37,300 --> 00:08:38,020
大家好啊
Hey, guys.

279
00:08:38,020 --> 00:08:38,680
抱歉我们迟到了
Sorry we're late,

280
00:08:38,680 --> 00:08:39,920
但我们带了红酒
but we come with wine.

281
00:08:39,920 --> 00:08:41,800
还有雕刻艺术哦
And whittlin'!

282
00:08:41,800 --> 00:08:42,720
看看
Check it out.

283
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:44,580
这是我父亲做的美丽礼物
This is a beautiful gift my father made

284
00:08:44,580 --> 00:08:46,320
为了放在结婚蛋糕上面的
for the top of our wedding cake.

285
00:08:46,540 --> 00:08:49,000
我猜他肥皂用光了所以没把我放进去
I guess he ran out of soap before he got to me.

286
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:51,140
-太糟了 -给你
- Darn. - For you.

287
00:08:51,140 --> 00:08:52,140
女士们 来看看
Ladies, check out

288
00:08:52,140 --> 00:08:54,485
肥皂版的米奇尔和小卡叔叔
your uncle Mitch and Cam in soap.

289
00:08:54,920 --> 00:08:56,120
那是肥皂做的吗
That's soap?

290
00:08:56,417 --> 00:08:58,120
太漂亮了
It's beautiful.

291
00:08:58,120 --> 00:08:59,480
这是我最恐怖的噩梦
This is my worst nightmare.

292
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:01,480
你不应该把否决权都浪费了的
You shouldn't have blown through those vetoes.

293
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:03,000
这就是小卡爸爸眼里的我
This is how Cam's dad sees me --

294
00:09:03,020 --> 00:09:04,380
像个谄媚的黄花闺女一样
like some fawning damsel.

295
00:09:04,560 --> 00:09:05,980
小卡更像个黄花闺女
If anything, Cam's the damsel.

296
00:09:06,060 --> 00:09:06,360
爸
Dad!

297
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:08,640
谢谢
Thank you.

298
00:09:08,940 --> 00:09:10,940
大婚之前什么都可能发生
A lot can happen before the big day.

299
00:09:11,440 --> 00:09:12,740
相信我 我什么招都试过了
Believe me, I've already tried.

300
00:09:14,180 --> 00:09:15,480
那东西简直坚不可摧
That thing is indestructible.

301
00:09:16,060 --> 00:09:17,420
如果它消失不见了呢
What if it went missing?

302
00:09:18,020 --> 00:09:19,500
我这里可总是丢东西
Things disappear around here all the time.

303
00:09:19,820 --> 00:09:20,640
是吗
Do they?

304
00:09:22,100 --> 00:09:23,440
一直都是
All the time.

305
00:09:23,440 --> 00:09:26,000
我有个小伙伴
Let's just say I have a friend

306
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:28,100
总在这样的时刻帮我
who helps me in these kinds of situations.

307
00:09:28,840 --> 00:09:29,380
我听着呢
I'm listening.

308
00:09:29,520 --> 00:09:30,420
你知道的越少越好
The less you know, the better.

309
00:09:30,500 --> 00:09:31,420
那我不听了
I'm not listening.

310
00:09:32,360 --> 00:09:33,620
这段对话从没发生过
We never had this conversation.

311
00:09:33,620 --> 00:09:35,520
这是段"没话"
This is a non-versation.

312
00:09:35,520 --> 00:09:35,860
是的
Right.

313
00:09:36,175 --> 00:09:39,104
我要你 "不动手"
I am giving you the...no-ahead.

314
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:50,120
我太想念你们了
Oh, I miss you girls.

315
00:09:50,120 --> 00:09:53,559
我的白人家庭里没人觉得我幽默
Nobody in my white family thinks that I am funny.

316
00:09:54,740 --> 00:09:57,020
亲 赫克托遇到你前有自己的人生
Honey, Hector had a life before he met you.

317
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:59,000
所以我就得和他前任一起吃饭吗
So I have to eat dinner with his ex?

318
00:09:59,060 --> 00:10:00,660
那你肯定不想让他自己去吧
Well, you certainly don't want him going alone --

319
00:10:00,660 --> 00:10:01,740
特别是他还有那么段历史
Not with his history.

320
00:10:03,680 --> 00:10:04,880
你到底是生谁的气呢
Who are you really mad at?

321
00:10:04,880 --> 00:10:06,724
我不知道
Ay, I don't know.

322
00:10:06,724 --> 00:10:08,580
说说吧 路易莎
Come on, Luisa.

323
00:10:08,580 --> 00:10:09,400
劳尔
Raul!

324
00:10:10,380 --> 00:10:12,700
赫克托会像劳尔那样伤我的心
Hector's going to hurt me just like Raul did!

325
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:13,660
这就是了
There it is.

326
00:10:13,880 --> 00:10:15,380
但赫克托不是劳尔 对吗
But Hector isn't raul, okay?

327
00:10:15,640 --> 00:10:16,440
他们只是表亲而已
They're just cousins.

328
00:10:18,100 --> 00:10:19,460
我们得走了
We need to get a move on.

329
00:10:19,460 --> 00:10:21,652
客户会在四点来看房
The client's gonna come over to the apartment at 4:00.

330
00:10:21,652 --> 00:10:23,989
我太忙了 脱不开身
I am swamped. I can't just leave.

331
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:25,500
歌洛莉亚 我们是来这卖你的公寓的
Gloria, we're here to sell your apartment.

332
00:10:25,580 --> 00:10:26,640
不是来发廊打工的
We don't work at the salon.

333
00:10:26,640 --> 00:10:27,940
非常感谢 比安卡
Muchísimas gracias, Bianca.

334
00:10:27,950 --> 00:10:29,713
别再跟那个男人发短信了
No más texting ese hombre.

335
00:10:29,940 --> 00:10:31,840
这是一对快生小孩的年轻夫妇
It's for a young couple with a baby on the way.

336
00:10:31,960 --> 00:10:32,560
买房不是为了转手赚钱
They're not flippers.

337
00:10:32,660 --> 00:10:34,620
他们是想找个地方安定下来
They're looking for a place to settle down and make a home.

338
00:10:34,780 --> 00:10:35,760
跟他们换个时间
Okay, just move them.

339
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:37,340
要是他们真想要这房子肯定会回来的
If they really want it, they'll come back.

340
00:10:37,380 --> 00:10:38,340
可是 歌洛莉亚
But, Gloria --

341
00:10:38,340 --> 00:10:40,494
拜托你帮我处理一下安娜的锡纸
Ay, please, just help me with Anna's foils.

342
00:10:40,494 --> 00:10:42,517
我得赶紧去帮人驳发
I have a weave emergency!

343
00:10:44,580 --> 00:10:45,440
有点不对劲
Something's not right.

344
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:46,066
什么 怎么了
Qué qué pasó?

345
00:10:46,066 --> 00:10:48,037
不 不 跟你没关系 你好着呢
No, no, no, not with you. You look great.

346
00:10:48,037 --> 00:10:49,080
你知道谁会痛恨这个造型吗
You know who's gonna hate this,

347
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:50,940
对你羡慕嫉妒恨的小姐妹
is a certain jealous sister.

348
00:10:50,940 --> 00:10:53,586
来 我们击个掌
Cinco de my, oh, my.

349
00:10:57,457 --> 00:10:59,980
我这儿有这么多个"I"让我怎么玩
How am I supposed to do this with so many "I"s on my rack?

350
00:10:59,980 --> 00:11:00,340
真抱歉
Sorry.

351
00:11:01,240 --> 00:11:01,740
卢克在哪儿
Where's Luke?

352
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:03,260
他拿个字典要这么久吗
How long does it take him to get the dictionary?

353
00:11:03,360 --> 00:11:04,620
我们很清楚地告诉他字典长什么样子了
We described it for him perfectly.

354
00:11:05,340 --> 00:11:05,800
等等
Wait a minute.

355
00:11:06,040 --> 00:11:07,840
他不会是不回来了吧
He's not coming back.

356
00:11:09,069 --> 00:11:09,917
移动你的"S"
Ugh. Move your "S."

357
00:11:09,917 --> 00:11:11,491
我已经走得够快了
I-I'm going as fast as I can.

358
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:14,160
米奇尔 它不见了
Mitchell! It's gone!

359
00:11:14,320 --> 00:11:15,000
什么东西
What is?

360
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:15,940
那个蛋糕装饰人偶
The cake topper.

361
00:11:16,580 --> 00:11:17,940
莉莉 你有看到之前跟你一起洗澡的
Lily, have you seen the little daddies

362
00:11:17,940 --> 00:11:18,960
小版爸爸们吗
you were bathing with earlier?

363
00:11:19,140 --> 00:11:19,860
别这么说话
Don't say that.

364
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:21,640
我看到斯黛拉在玩它
I saw Stella playing with it.

365
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:22,040
什么
What?

366
00:11:22,860 --> 00:11:24,220
瞧瞧她身上 全是泥巴
Oh, look at her. She's all muddy.

367
00:11:24,280 --> 00:11:25,980
她肯定是叼出去埋起来了
She must have brought it outside and buried it.

368
00:11:26,040 --> 00:11:27,220
她老是做这种事
She does it all the time!

369
00:11:27,300 --> 00:11:28,880
不 我们必须找到它
Oh, no. We have to go find it.

370
00:11:28,940 --> 00:11:29,340
祝你们好运
Good luck.

371
00:11:29,360 --> 00:11:30,940
那东西估计是找不到了
That thing's as good as gone.

372
00:11:31,560 --> 00:11:32,360
真糟糕
Dang it!

373
00:11:32,900 --> 00:11:34,020
最惨的是
And the worst part is,

374
00:11:34,020 --> 00:11:35,680
我们连张照片都没来得及拍
we don't even have a picture of it.

375
00:11:35,700 --> 00:11:36,180
我们有吗
Do we?

376
00:11:36,340 --> 00:11:37,360
我们不能放弃
Okay, we can't give up.

377
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:38,700
我们去院子里找找看
Let's go out into the yard and look for it.

378
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:40,140
注意点 换成我是不会干涉斯黛拉
Careful. I wouldn't come between Stella

379
00:11:40,140 --> 00:11:41,160
藏任何东西的
and anything she's buried.

380
00:11:41,240 --> 00:11:42,040
她有自己的天性
She's a wild animal.

381
00:11:42,120 --> 00:11:43,380
不会别人告诉她会做什么
No telling what she'll do.

382
00:11:44,260 --> 00:11:47,160
这姿势真是充满挑衅的味道
That's a very aggressive stance.

383
00:11:53,180 --> 00:11:54,100
卢克 等等
Luke! Wait!

384
00:11:54,380 --> 00:11:55,680
瞧瞧你
Oh. Look at that.

385
00:11:55,860 --> 00:11:56,520
你都离开院子了
You left your yard,

386
00:11:56,520 --> 00:11:58,080
你的电子项圈居然没有响
and your little shock collar didn't go off.

387
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:58,500
卢克
Luke --

388
00:11:58,500 --> 00:12:00,400
好了 新计划是这样的
Okay, so, here's the new plan.

389
00:12:00,400 --> 00:12:01,920
你站后面 由我先来活跃气氛
You hang back while I break the ice,

390
00:12:02,040 --> 00:12:03,160
等到一个恰当的时候
and then, when the time is right --

391
00:12:03,160 --> 00:12:04,560
曼尼 你来了
Manny! You made it!

392
00:12:06,440 --> 00:12:07,160
这是谁
Who's this?

393
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:09,860
这是谁
"Who's this?"

394
00:12:10,300 --> 00:12:11,080
拜托
Excuse me,

395
00:12:11,080 --> 00:12:13,734
克里斯蒂·胸器 我是有名字的
Kristy huge ones, I have a name.

396
00:12:13,880 --> 00:12:14,640
好了 别闹了
Okay, come on. Stop.

397
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:15,900
我追了你一整天已经受够了
I'm tired of chasing you all day.

398
00:12:16,040 --> 00:12:16,680
那就别追我
Then don't.

399
00:12:16,740 --> 00:12:18,720
去那个无聊的派对上玩吧
Stay as long as you want at that lame party.

400
00:12:19,180 --> 00:12:19,860
你想聊聊吗
You want to talk?

401
00:12:20,360 --> 00:12:22,500
你才应该是那个呆呆的配角 不是我
You're the dorky sidekick, not me.

402
00:12:22,860 --> 00:12:23,640
能稍微友好点吗
Want to talk nicer?

403
00:12:24,042 --> 00:12:26,654
凭什么她请你不请我
How could you be invited and I wasn't?

404
00:12:26,900 --> 00:12:27,840
我不知道
I don't know.

405
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:30,340
貌似过去我身上让人觉得奇怪的地方
It's like the stuff that used to make me kind of weird,

406
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,340
开始招人喜欢了
people are starting to like.

407
00:12:32,520 --> 00:12:32,920
所以呢
So?

408
00:12:32,920 --> 00:12:34,520
我还跟以前一样
I'm the same as I always was.

409
00:12:34,945 --> 00:12:37,431
说不定你可以提高一下自己
Well...maybe you could upgrade a little.

410
00:12:37,452 --> 00:12:39,620
我们受够了你的"尤达"音
Uh, we're tired of the yoda voice,

411
00:12:39,620 --> 00:12:41,180
如果有个女孩告诉你她去了伦敦
and if a girl tells you she went to london,

412
00:12:41,180 --> 00:12:43,260
最好别问她是不是看见了法国
maybe don't ask if she also saw France.

413
00:12:44,980 --> 00:12:46,860
我还是喜欢
I liked things better when you were the one

414
00:12:46,860 --> 00:12:48,180
你比较像鸵鸟的时候
who was ostrich-sized.

415
00:12:48,180 --> 00:12:48,540
什么
What?

416
00:12:49,200 --> 00:12:51,200
你懂的 一个怪异的圈外人
You know, like a freaky outsider --

417
00:12:51,800 --> 00:12:53,800
鹤立鸡群的感觉
the way an ostrich feels around regular birds.

418
00:12:54,400 --> 00:12:55,760
你知道女孩子还喜欢什么吗
You know what else girls like?

419
00:12:55,940 --> 00:12:57,340
神秘又安静的类型
The mysterious, silent type.

420
00:13:01,020 --> 00:13:02,300
你在对我的酱汁做什么 伙计
What are you doing with my sauce, there, cookie?

421
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:03,200
那才是你的
That's yours.

422
00:13:03,660 --> 00:13:04,320
这是我的
This is mine.

423
00:13:04,340 --> 00:13:05,340
我早上就准备好了
I prepped it this morning.

424
00:13:05,360 --> 00:13:06,420
我想了下 为什么不做呢
I figured, why not make it?

425
00:13:06,420 --> 00:13:08,960
因为我已经做好了
Um...maybe because I already made sauce?

426
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:10,000
多多益善
Can't have too much.

427
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:10,940
是吗
Can't ya?

428
00:13:10,940 --> 00:13:11,980
把汤勺递给我
Hand me that ladle, huh?

429
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:15,400
你干嘛 我已经拿住了
What are you doing? I got it.

430
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:16,140
你要说什么
What do you say?

431
00:13:16,580 --> 00:13:16,840
什么
What?

432
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:19,500
当别人为你做事的时候你要说什么
What do you say when somebody does something for you?

433
00:13:19,500 --> 00:13:20,060
你要说什么
What do you say?

434
00:13:20,160 --> 00:13:21,760
你想让我谢谢你把汤勺给我吗
You want me to thank you for handing me a ladle?

435
00:13:21,840 --> 00:13:23,580
你感谢了狗狗站着不动
You thanked the dog for staying --

436
00:13:23,620 --> 00:13:24,660
虽然它其实什么都没做
which is basically doing nothing --

437
00:13:24,700 --> 00:13:25,700
所以我确定你知道该怎么说
so I know you know the words.

438
00:13:25,740 --> 00:13:25,960
好吧
Fine.

439
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:28,235
谢谢你把汤勺递给我
Thank you for handling me the ladle.

440
00:13:30,840 --> 00:13:31,840
你确定这些煮好了吗
You sure those are ready?

441
00:13:31,860 --> 00:13:32,960
你还没往墙上扔呢
You didn't throw one against the wall.

442
00:13:32,960 --> 00:13:35,620
爸 现在没有人这么做了
Oh, dad, nobody does that anymore.

443
00:13:35,620 --> 00:13:38,200
就是说我们做所有事都换新方法了是吧
Oh. I guess we have new ways for doing everything now, huh?

444
00:13:38,320 --> 00:13:39,380
不 我可没那么说
No. I didn't say that.

445
00:13:39,460 --> 00:13:40,960
我只是说你可以直接尝一下熟了没有
I'm just saying that you can taste your food

446
00:13:40,960 --> 00:13:43,260
而不是像黑猩猩一样往墙上甩
instead of flinging it at the wall like a chimp.

447
00:13:43,260 --> 00:13:43,400
好吧
Okay.

448
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:44,900
味道如何
How's it taste?

449
00:13:47,603 --> 00:13:49,360
事实上 还不错
Actually, mm, that's pretty good.

450
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:51,120
但是如果能加点
But it could use a little,

451
00:13:51,120 --> 00:13:53,675
酱料
um...sauce.

452
00:13:53,824 --> 00:13:55,490
我来试试 好烫
Let me just -- ooh, hot.

453
00:13:59,420 --> 00:14:00,900
再加点帕尔马干酪
Try a little Parmesan with that?

454
00:14:02,640 --> 00:14:04,480
我应该把面包放进烤箱了
I should probably get that bread in the oven.

455
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:05,736
只要
Just...

456
00:14:06,080 --> 00:14:06,960
好了 好了
Okay! Hey!

457
00:14:07,220 --> 00:14:09,040
这里交给我们吧
Hey, how about we take over in here

458
00:14:09,040 --> 00:14:10,560
你们去收拾一下准备吃饭了
while you two get cleaned up for dinner?

459
00:14:10,560 --> 00:14:10,940
好主意
Yes, good idea.

460
00:14:11,360 --> 00:14:12,460
好的
Yeah. Okay.

461
00:14:13,060 --> 00:14:14,040
自我肯定首先要来源于自身
Approval comes from within.

462
00:14:14,100 --> 00:14:14,660
谢谢
Thank you.

463
00:14:15,040 --> 00:14:16,260
你的酱料需要加点蒜
Your sauce needs garlic.

464
00:14:16,340 --> 00:14:17,741
-好了 -好了
- Okay. - Okay.

465
00:14:18,220 --> 00:14:19,360
这是个表
And that's a clock.

466
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:20,900
好吧 再试另一个地方
Okay, well, do another one.

467
00:14:20,900 --> 00:14:21,780
我试了四个了
I've done like four.

468
00:14:21,980 --> 00:14:23,620
这只狗比你叔叔克莱顿还爱囤东西
This dog is a worse hoarder than your uncle Clayton.

469
00:14:23,700 --> 00:14:24,740
他是个收藏家
He's a collector.

470
00:14:24,740 --> 00:14:26,361
收藏过期酸奶吗
Of expired yogurt?

471
00:14:27,960 --> 00:14:28,520
累死我了
Getting tired.

472
00:14:28,940 --> 00:14:30,820
小卡 能不能别找了
Cam, can we just stop, please?

473
00:14:31,140 --> 00:14:32,080
我觉得我们已经尽力了
I feel like we've done our best,

474
00:14:32,080 --> 00:14:33,320
肯定是找不到了
but we're just not gonna find it.

475
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:33,951
找到了
Found it!

476
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:35,100
太好了
Oh! Good.

477
00:14:35,620 --> 00:14:36,080
谢天谢地
Thank god.

478
00:14:36,240 --> 00:14:38,380
我还没告诉你我对它的宏伟计划呢
I hadn't even told you my biggest plan for this yet.

479
00:14:38,540 --> 00:14:39,700
比装饰蛋糕还宏伟的计划吗
Bigger than the top of our wedding cake?

480
00:14:39,920 --> 00:14:42,100
我要用它做个模子然后批量生产
I'm gonna have a mold made of it and give a reproduction

481
00:14:42,100 --> 00:14:43,460
赠送给每一位来参加婚礼的
to everyone who comes to the wedding

482
00:14:43,460 --> 00:14:44,960
和来不了的客人
and everyone who can't come to the wedding.

483
00:14:45,280 --> 00:14:47,920
想象一下数百个我们的人偶散布全国
Imagine hundreds of these across the country.

484
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:48,320
不
No!

485
00:14:48,940 --> 00:14:50,260
不行 不行 绝对不行
No! No! Absolutely not!

486
00:14:50,320 --> 00:14:51,300
我讨厌它 太恶心了
I hate it! It's awful!

487
00:14:51,860 --> 00:14:52,980
我就知道
I knew it!

488
00:14:53,260 --> 00:14:54,220
我就知道
I knew it!

489
00:14:54,400 --> 00:14:56,220
它只是恰巧出现在莉莉的浴缸里
It just shows up in Lily's bath,

490
00:14:56,220 --> 00:14:58,360
然后突然间 又被狗叼走了吗
and then, all of a sudden, the dog has it?

491
00:14:58,460 --> 00:15:00,720
你就是故意盯着它不放
You have it in for this beautiful topper.

492
00:15:00,800 --> 00:15:02,480
你看看 你好好看看它
Look at this. Look at it. Look at it!

493
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:04,185
你一副威风凛凛大块头的样子
Come on, you're all heroic and Paul Bunyan-y,

494
00:15:04,195 --> 00:15:05,830
我呢 我就像个娘娘腔
and I'm -- I'm, like, some sissy man

495
00:15:05,830 --> 00:15:08,140
红着脸颊 夹着腿
with -- with pinkish cheeks and a turned-out heel.

496
00:15:08,140 --> 00:15:09,580
那只是一种表现形式
It's a caricature.

497
00:15:10,340 --> 00:15:12,200
重要的是它代表的意义
What matters is what it represents.

498
00:15:14,500 --> 00:15:16,880
说明他已经接受了我们本来的样子
means he's accepted us for who we are!

499
00:15:17,340 --> 00:15:18,500
你难道不明白吗
Don't you get that?

500
00:15:18,900 --> 00:15:20,720
我倒是没有从这个角度想过
I never really thought about it that way.

501
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:22,540
你确实没有
No. You hadn't.

502
00:15:25,080 --> 00:15:26,920
我只是有些敏感了
I'm just being sensitive.

503
00:15:27,140 --> 00:15:28,700
我应该神经再大条一点
I need to have a thicker skin.

504
00:15:28,700 --> 00:15:30,714
我真的非常非常抱歉
I-I'm really, really sorry.

505
00:15:31,205 --> 00:15:33,420
不 不用抱歉
No, don't -- don't -- don't be sorry.

506
00:15:33,420 --> 00:15:33,900
不用
No.

507
00:15:34,192 --> 00:15:36,220
我不希望有你不喜欢的东西
And I -- n-- I don't want something at the wedding

508
00:15:36,220 --> 00:15:37,200
出现在婚礼上
that makes you uncomfortable.

509
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:38,560
不 那不太公平
Well, no, that doesn't seem fair.

510
00:15:38,560 --> 00:15:40,100
我的否决权已经用光了
I've used up all my vetoes.

511
00:15:41,760 --> 00:15:42,700
如果
Well, if it --

512
00:15:43,420 --> 00:15:45,040
能让你好受一些的话
I guess, if it makes you feel better,

513
00:15:45,040 --> 00:15:46,660
我可以再给你加一个否决权
I could give you one more veto --

514
00:15:46,660 --> 00:15:48,500
但你也要给我加一个
if you give me one more, too.

515
00:15:49,460 --> 00:15:50,340
好吧 当然可以
Okay, sure.

516
00:15:50,580 --> 00:15:51,720
如果以后
And in the future,

517
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:52,440
有什么事情
if there's anything --

518
00:15:52,540 --> 00:15:53,340
辞掉婚礼歌手
The wedding singer.

519
00:15:59,880 --> 00:16:01,000
好的 谢谢 爸爸
Okay. Thanks, daddy.

520
00:16:01,080 --> 00:16:02,860
我会给你一张非常适合的照片作参考
I'll send you the perfect picture to model it on.

521
00:16:08,380 --> 00:16:09,800
今天过后我相信了
After today, I'm convinced

522
00:16:09,800 --> 00:16:11,680
10%的填埋垃圾是头发
our landfills are 10% hair.

523
00:16:11,960 --> 00:16:12,780
是啊
Oh, yes.

524
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:15,600
我都忘记这事这么累人了
I forgot how exhausting this is.

525
00:16:15,740 --> 00:16:16,620
现在我们只需要
Well, all we have to do

526
00:16:16,620 --> 00:16:18,200
回公寓去见一下客户
is meet the clients back at the apartment,

527
00:16:18,200 --> 00:16:19,080
然后就可以回家了
and then we can head home.

528
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:20,930
不 我现在好累
Ay, no. I'm too tired now.

529
00:16:20,940 --> 00:16:21,880
改期吧
Let's reschedule.

530
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:23,040
真的吗 还改
Really? Again?

531
00:16:23,560 --> 00:16:25,800
是啊 下周再见吧
Yes. Let's meet them next week.

532
00:16:25,800 --> 00:16:27,700
而且 杰的聚会我们已经迟到了
And besides, we're late for Jay's party.

533
00:16:28,280 --> 00:16:30,880
我不会让你这个样子回家的
Well, I'm not letting you go home looking like this.

534
00:16:31,020 --> 00:16:32,080
你头发后面有点乱
You're a little ratty back here.

535
00:16:32,241 --> 00:16:33,449
是啊
Ay, no.

536
00:16:33,449 --> 00:16:35,196
没事 没事 我来
No, no, no. I got it.

537
00:16:35,760 --> 00:16:36,680
你放松就好
You just relax.

538
00:16:39,220 --> 00:16:41,320
今天真是够累的
What a day, huh?

539
00:16:41,560 --> 00:16:43,880
回到这里一定唤起了你很多回忆
Being back here must bring up a lot of memories.

540
00:16:44,220 --> 00:16:45,040
是啊
Oh, yeah.

541
00:16:45,240 --> 00:16:46,480
也许还有一些情绪
Maybe even some emotions.

542
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:48,320
是啊 感觉怪怪的
Yeah. It feels weird.

543
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:49,320
怪是一个形容词
No, weird's an adjective,

544
00:16:49,320 --> 00:16:50,600
不是一种情绪 但你继续说
not an emotion, but go on.

545
00:16:51,180 --> 00:16:54,280
我现在的生活与以前大不相同
Well, it's just that my life now is so different than before --

546
00:16:54,740 --> 00:16:55,760
轻松多了
so much easier.

547
00:16:56,060 --> 00:16:58,240
所以你觉得
And that makes you feel...?

548
00:16:58,336 --> 00:16:58,520
很好
Good.

549
00:16:58,520 --> 00:17:00,180
还有呢
And also...?

550
00:17:00,453 --> 00:17:00,973
也不好
And bad.

551
00:17:00,980 --> 00:17:01,320
为什么
Why?

552
00:17:01,960 --> 00:17:02,740
我也不知道
I don't know.

553
00:17:03,100 --> 00:17:04,540
说说吧 歌洛莉亚
Come on, now, Gloria.

554
00:17:05,340 --> 00:17:05,880
我也不知道
I don't know.

555
00:17:05,880 --> 00:17:08,580
我想我只是觉得有些惭愧
I guess it just makes me feel a little ashamed.

556
00:17:09,100 --> 00:17:12,360
为什么会惭愧呢
Now, what in the world do you have to be ashamed of?

557
00:17:13,216 --> 00:17:14,720
只是 你懂的
It's just that, you know,

558
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:16,220
以前住在这里时
before, when I used to live here,

559
00:17:16,220 --> 00:17:18,300
我要努力工作赚钱
I used to work for every penny.

560
00:17:18,700 --> 00:17:20,820
我全靠自己
I would stand on my own two feet.

561
00:17:21,100 --> 00:17:23,500
现在我穿着这些昂贵的鞋子
Now I just stand on expensive shoes

562
00:17:23,500 --> 00:17:25,220
都是杰买给我的
that Jay buys for me.

563
00:17:25,300 --> 00:17:27,220
是因为这样才不想卖掉房子吗
Is that why it's so hard to let go of the apartment?

564
00:17:27,600 --> 00:17:28,800
不 菲尔 不是因为这个
No, Phil, it's not that --

565
00:17:28,800 --> 00:17:29,120
歌洛莉亚
Gloria.

566
00:17:30,040 --> 00:17:30,480
也许是吧
Maybe.

567
00:17:31,940 --> 00:17:32,380
歌洛莉亚
Gloria.

568
00:17:33,420 --> 00:17:33,860
是的
Yes.

569
00:17:33,860 --> 00:17:35,960
它是最后一件属于原来的我的东西
It's the last piece of the old me.

570
00:17:36,865 --> 00:17:38,358
停 停 你太用力了
No, no! You're going too deep!

571
00:17:38,358 --> 00:17:39,960
抱歉抱歉
Oh. I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

572
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:42,340
对不起 但我觉得你的想法不对
I'm sorry, but I think you're looking at this all wrong.

573
00:17:42,560 --> 00:17:43,800
原来的你还在这里
The old you hasn't gone anywhere.

574
00:17:43,940 --> 00:17:46,140
看你培养曼尼和乔的方式
I-I-I see it in the way you're raising Manny and Joe,

575
00:17:46,420 --> 00:17:47,780
看你照顾杰的样子
the way you care for Jay.

576
00:17:48,180 --> 00:17:50,860
你从没把任何东西当作理所当然
You never take anyone or anything for granted.

577
00:17:52,500 --> 00:17:53,820
你多年来一直努力工作
You worked hard for years

578
00:17:53,820 --> 00:17:55,631
那时你也不知道生活会不会变好
without knowing that things were gonna get better.

579
00:17:56,240 --> 00:17:57,860
然后你得到了回报
And then the universe rewarded you.

580
00:17:57,880 --> 00:17:59,240
这没什么好惭愧的
There's nothing to be ashamed of.

581
00:18:00,360 --> 00:18:01,420
你不会因为
So you're not mad at me

582
00:18:01,420 --> 00:18:02,960
我不想卖房子而生气吧
because I don't want to sell the apartment?

583
00:18:03,200 --> 00:18:03,640
不会
No.

584
